I can see the vulnerability. In the `MQTT_CMD_PUBLISH` case, when `version == 5`:

```c
if (version == 5 && p + 2 < end) {
    m->props_size = decode_variable_length((char *) p, &len_len);
    m->props_start = (size_t)(p + len_len - buf);
    p += len_len + m->props_size;
}
```

The `decode_variable_length` function reads a variable-length integer. Let me look at that function to understand the potential out-of-bounds read.

